#### 처음 Sand cook의 정확한 통과 범위와 두 가지 발견

`sand/sand_windows_cook_v001/report.json` SHA
`f7b6c9fd019c84b7ac96cdc07f3838659bc78163819fafb0c5cb4105bef57320`은 UE5.6.1
CL44394996, Windows, `-DisablePlugins=UnrealMCP -NullRHI -CookSkipRequests`에서
exit0, 384 cooked packages, own cooked files570개, 1465 inputs before==after였다.
